            Paragraph(Text("Finite-head zero-energy reconstruction and this original metric imply positive definiteness of the actual three-column Gram at every cutoff. This is a qualitative statement and does not give either branch of sorted spectral asymptotics or a conclusion about RH or Robin.")),
